  "texts": {
    "preamble": "G.Kannan vs The Food Safety Officer on 21 August, 2025 Author: N.Sathish Kumar Bench: N. Sathish Kumar In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 21-08-2025 Coram The Honourable Mr Justice N. Sathish Kumar Wp No. 31488 of 2025 & WMP.No.35251 of 2025 1. G.Kannan S /o.Gopal, Residing At No.9, 2nd Cross Street, Srinviasa Nagar, Alapakkam Main Road, Maduravoyal, Chennai-600 095 And Running A Shop M/s.Satheeshstore, At No.82/7, Alapakkam Main Road, Maduravoyal, Chennai-600 095. Vs 1. The Food Safety Officer Tamilnadu Department Of Food Safety And Drugs, Administration Department, Tiruvallur District.",
    "facts": "The case of the respondent is that the petitioner was found selling banned tobacco products in his shop and therefore, a case has been registered against the petitioner for the offences 296[b], 132, 351 [2], 274, 275, 123 BNS and Section 6[b] read with 24[1] of COTPA Act and 77 of JJ Act and the petitioner's shop has been sealed. 3. It is the contention of the learned counsel appearing for the petitioner that he had not sold any banned tobacco products in his shop and he is ready to file an affidavit before the respondent to the effect that he will not sell any banned tobacco products in his shop. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis",
